# Universal Document Workspace

A privacy-first, offline-capable Android application for managing and working with PDFs, office files, images, scanned documents, signatures, and share workflows.

This repository is scaffolded as a modular Android project using Kotlin and Jetpack Compose.

## Status

This initial version establishes the app architecture, navigation shell, dashboard, document management layout, and module boundaries for future phases.

## Modules

- app
- core
- core-ui
- file-manager
- document-engine
- pdf-engine
- scanner
- search
- share
- workspace
- security
- settings

## Planned phases

1. Core file manager, dashboard, search, recent files
2. PDF viewing and annotation
3. Scanner, image-to-PDF, signature
4. Office viewer support
5. Conversion and export tools
6. Share Board and secure local sharing
7. Corporate workflow and access control
